## 2. Proposed merge order

1. website — leaf repo, self-contained status page + JS.
2. install — leaf repo, installer URL/package fixes.
3. catalog — leaf repo, public index rewrite; schedule the
   index.minisig re-sign (manager-held secret) with the merge.
4. oodac — diverged but zero path overlap; merge commit or rebase
   wip onto ooda tip first. Docs-only; still the off-limits repo.
5. openOODA LAST — contains foreign iso commits and has a dirty
   working tree (see below); merge only after owner confirms the
   two iso commits ride along.

